    "Meeterz erinnert alle rechtzeitig ans Losfahren – mit aktuellem Verkehr.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz erinnert alle rechtzeitig ans Losfahren – mit aktuellem Verkehr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz reminds everyone to leave on time – with current traffic."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz rappelle à chacun de partir à temps – avec le trafic actuel."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz recuerda a todos cuándo salir, con el tráfico actual."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Meeterz lembra todos de partir a tempo – com o trânsito atual."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz herkese güncel trafiğe göre zamanında yola çıkmayı hatırlatır."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz ricorda a tutti di partire in tempo, con il traffico attuale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meeterz übernimmt Akkustand, Reichweite und Ladezustand live aus deinem Auto – über das Home-Assistant-Add-on „MG to ABRP Bridge“ (iSMART). Damit entfällt die Akku-Eingabe in CarPlay, und die Ladeplanung rechnet mit echten Werten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz übernimmt Akkustand, Reichweite und Ladezustand live aus deinem Auto – über das Home-Assistant-Add-on „MG to ABRP Bridge“ (iSMART). Damit entfällt die Akku-Eingabe in CarPlay, und die Ladeplanung rechnet mit echten Werten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz takes battery level, range and charging state live from your car – via the Home Assistant add-on “MG to ABRP Bridge” (iSMART). No more entering the battery level in CarPlay, and charge planning uses real values."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz récupère en direct le niveau de batterie, l’autonomie et l’état de charge de ta voiture – via le module Home Assistant « MG to ABRP Bridge » (iSMART). Plus besoin de saisir la batterie dans CarPlay, et la planification utilise des valeurs réelles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz toma en vivo el nivel de batería, la autonomía y el estado de carga de tu coche mediante el complemento de Home Assistant «MG to ABRP Bridge» (iSMART). Ya no hace falta introducir la batería en CarPlay y la planificación usa valores reales."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Meeterz obtém ao vivo o nível da bateria, a autonomia e o estado de carregamento do teu carro – através do add-on do Home Assistant «MG to ABRP Bridge» (iSMART). Deixa de ser preciso introduzir a bateria no CarPlay e o planeamento usa valores reais."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz batarya seviyesini, menzili ve şarj durumunu Home Assistant eklentisi “MG to ABRP Bridge” (iSMART) üzerinden arabandan canlı alır. CarPlay’de batarya girmene gerek kalmaz, şarj planı gerçek değerlerle hesaplanır."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz rileva in diretta livello della batteria, autonomia e stato di ricarica della tua auto tramite il componente di Home Assistant «MG to ABRP Bridge» (iSMART). Non serve più inserire la batteria in CarPlay e la pianificazione usa valori reali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meeterz: Inkognito": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeterz: Inkognito"
